worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_creative.js"
  ceiling 653
  rationale "Creative composition, part one (issue #1178): brainstorming and advice, browser twin (PR #1188 JavaScript-first parity). JavaScript-first twin of native handler keys (brainstorm_composition, advice_request), added under R997-R999 (2026-10-06); growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling 653 (2026-11-15, issue #1550 criterion d): creativeAnswer exposes the kept brainstorming candidates as `candidate` events, as the native brainstorm handler logs `brainstorming:<name>` candidates, so both runtimes select among the same candidates."
